# This repository is PUBLIC.
#
# Only generic, non-identifying design documentation belongs in this directory.
# Operating data — contacts, accounts, company facts, client material — lives in
# local storage on the operator's machine and must never be committed.
#
# This file is a mechanical backstop, not a substitute for judgment. If a file
# would let a reader identify a person, an employer, or a client, it does not
# belong here even if this file does not happen to match its name.

# --- Contact and personal data ---
contacts/
contact*/
*contact*.json
*contact*.csv
*contact*.md
people/
roster*
*roster*
directory/
*.vcf

